マム・バーストォ！」のように受けようとしている攻撃がカオスMAXであることがわかる）\n\n(B)コアの上に座ったり肘をついたり足蹴にするような感じで前を向いているイヴリース。一番想像に近いのはジョジョ1部のOPの最後に出てくる、椅子に座ったままジョナサンを迎え撃つディオのポーズです。（足は組んでなくてもいいです。）\n\n可能であればTwitterのヘッダーかアイコンに使用したいです。\n\nぐっちーさんの書きたい方でよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 18881, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "あいんつ", "screen_name": "einz_zwei", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2115119226440847360/a2CIddFN.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/173417942/1742470639/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 285802, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "Darjeeling@Skeb募集中", "screen_name": "xdarjeelingxtea", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1587012861372473344/ZNVDbJWg.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3151075550/1606468000/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 61, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 1104723, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "タヌキマン@skeb募集中🌏", "screen_name": "sakanamantohihi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1685439606458929152/caDXaZSL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1554512266875154432/1670430646/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acce